          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ingrātus is built on in- \"not\" and grātus \"pleasing, grateful\" (Lewis & Short). English ingratitude and ingrate come from it."
            }
          ]
        },
